[{:adr/consequences "{:isolation \"3 substrates each own one concern; no cycles; aozora-deploy = identity reg (1x), runtime publish attributed by venue\", :venues \"user-WASM and fleet-kototama both materialize the same CID from kotoba, both publish to aozora; attribution differs (user vs actor+leash)\", :reuse \"lands under existing nbb e7m consolidation; no new CLI binary (rename-only)\", :gaps \"{:pin-cli 'actor pin CLI not yet tidied', :kotodama-cells 'R0 scaffold', :build-wasm 'compiler+IDB exist but e7m actor build-wasm not wired', :leash 'member key is owner-supplied (no-server-key)'}\"}", :adr/authoritative_for ["3 substrate は対等な deploy 先でなく、storage/compute/publish の3関心事。aozora は compute 基盤でなく publish 先+identity 登録場所" "依存は厳密レイヤリング: author → kotoba → {murakumo|browser-WASM} → aozora。循環なし。3登録は互いに独立(idempotent)" "nbb e7m(ADR-2606222000)の下に 3 facet を1名詞で統合: e7m actor {mesh, pin(kotoba), reside(murakumo), identify(aozora), deploy --all}。既存 aozora:deploy=identify, kotobase:pin=pin, murakumo:deploy=reside のリネーム統合" "2 実行会場(browser-WASM=user主権 / murakumo kototama=communal 常駐)はどちらも kotoba から具現化し aozora へ publish。venue が署名帰属を分ける"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "substrate-architecture", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2606222000-nbb-e7m-cli-consolidation.edn" "90-docs/adr/2607022200-com-etzhayyim-tashikame-factcheck-aozora-actor-r0.edn" "90-docs/adr/2607022210-com-etzhayyim-kouhou-public-info-actor-r0.edn" "orgs/etzhayyim/root/70-tools/src/etzhayyim/aozora_deploy.cljc" "orgs/etzhayyim/root/50-infra/murakumo/fleet.edn" "orgs/gftdcojp/net-kotobase/kotoba/"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607022300-actor-deploy-3-substrate-topology", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-02", :adr/body "\n# ADR-2607022300: actor deploy 3-substrate topology — kotoba=storage / murakumo=compute / aozora=publish + unified `e7m actor` CLI\n\n**Status**: accepted (design; per-facet maturity varies — see §Registration maturity)\n**Date**: 2026-07-02\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Context\n\nオーナーが tashikame/kouhou の live aozora 投稿(deploy)を進める中で、**3 substrate CLI**(kotoba / murakumo / aozora)の**依存関係の美化**を問うた。実態(調査):\n\n- **kotoba** = Rust server CLI(`gftdcojp/net-kotobase/kotoba`: serve/block/quad/sparql/q/cypher/media/commit)。content-addressed Datom log + IPLD block + pin。browser-WASM 実行基盤(kotoba-clj compiler + kotoba-runtime + IdbBlockStore)は**部品はあるが actor deploy に未結線**(gap)。\n- **murakumo** = nbb tasks のみ(`nbb murakumo:deploy --node`, `nbb fleet:probe`)。10-node fleet + EVO-X2 inference(Ollama/LiteLLM)。lite_runner は issachar で LIVE、full kotodama cell は R0 scaffold。**kototama = kotodama cell を murakumo に常駐させた形**(用法であり別 codebase ではない)。\n- **aozora** = `nbb aozora:deploy <name> [--apply]`(shipped)。actor の profile record(rkey=self)+ did.json + lexicon を aozora.app PDS に createRecord。dry-run 既定、`--apply` + `LEASH`(member CACAO)で実効。\n- 統合 CLI は `nbb e7m`(ADR-2606222000 consolidation)に集約中。既存 e7m(TS)・etzhayyim-cli(Go)はレガシー。\n\nオーナーの素描:「actor → kotoba deploy → IPLD 永続化+pin → browser WASM(user 実行)」「kototama は murakumo deploy で常駐・分散 inference」「aozora cli にも deploy できるが適切か?」。\n\n## Decision\n\n### 1. 3 substrate は対等な「deploy 先」ではない — 3つの別関心事\n\n| substrate | 関心事(単一) | actor の何を登録 | 実行主体 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **kotoba** | storage(content-addressed Datom + IPLD + pin) | code + state(CID で検索可能) | なし(在り処) |\n| **murakumo** | compute(常駐)(fleet + 分散 inference) | kototama(常駐 Pregel cell) | ここで走る(fleet 側) |\n| **aozora** | publish/social(ATProto PDS) | identity(did + profile + lexicon) | なし(発話の宛先) |\n\n**aozora は actor が走る場所ではない。**「aozora に deploy する」は**identity 登録(1回・静的)**のこと solely。actor を aozora で走らせるのはカテゴリエラー。これは kotoba の pin、murakumo の reside と**対称な「登録」操作の1つ**にすぎない。\n\n### 2. 厳密なレイヤリング(循環なし)\n\n```\nAUTHOR (.cljc) ──mesh──▶ KOTOBA(storage: pin code+state by CID)\n                           │  materialize by CID\n                ┌──────────┴───────────┐\n                ▼                      ▼\n        EXECUTE 常駐                EXECUTE user側\n        murakumo kototama          browser WASM (主権的)\n        (分散 inference)           (IdbBlockStore)\n                │                      │\n                └───── both publish ───┘\n                            ▼\n                        AOZORA(publish: createRecord)\n                        identify: did+profile 登録(1回)\n```\n\n依存の向き: **author → kotoba → {murakumo | wasm} → aozora**。aozora は実行時に何にも依存しない(純 sink)。3つの登録は互いに独立(idempotent)。\n\n### 3. 2 実行会場の双対\n\n- **browser-WASM**(user 主権的): pinned code を CID で検証しつつ user 端末で実行 = no-server-key の純形。\n- **murakumo kototama**(communal 常駐): fleet で常駐・分散 inference・cron。\n- 両者とも**kotoba から同一物を具現化**し、**aozora へ publish**する。\n- 帰属の差: WASM からの publish は **user の鍵**、kototama からは **actor did + member CACAO leash**。これが aozora 側の署名帰属を分ける。\n\n### 4. 統合 CLI(`nbb e7m` の下、ADR-2606222000)\n\n3 facet を1名詞 `actor` の下に、各関心事=1動詞で揃える(既存 task のリネーム統合):\n\n```\ne7m actor mesh      <name>            # .cljc → kotoba.app.edn(共通前段)\ne7m actor pin       <name>  # kotoba  # code+state を IPLD pin(= nbb kotobase:pin)\ne7m actor reside    <name>  # murakumo# kototama を fleet に schedule(= nbb murakumo:deploy)\ne7m actor identify  <name>  # aozora  # did+profile+lexicon を PDS 登録(= nbb aozora:deploy)\ne7m actor deploy --all <name>         # 上3つを冪等に一括\ne7m actor post      <name> …          # runtime publish(実行会場から。別件)\n```\n\n「aozora cli で 1,2,3 を deploy」= **`e7m actor identify`**(= 既存 `aozora:deploy`)が (1) PDS did/profile 登録・(2) `LEASH` member CACAO・(3) createRecord 認証を担う。**既に8割 shipped**。残る gap は child-repo actor が manifest 形式を持たない点と(2)の member 鍵のみ。\n\n## Registration maturity(実態)\n\n| facet | 動詞 | 既存 | 成熟度 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| kotoba pin | `pin` | `nbb kotobase:pin` / `actor:mesh` | 🟡 土台あり・actor 用 pin CLI 未整理 |\n| murakumo reside | `reside` | `nbb murakumo:deploy --node` | 🟡 lite_runner LIVE・full kotodama cell は R0 |\n| aozora identify | `identify` | `nbb aozora:deploy [--apply]` | ✅ shipped |\n| browser-WASM 実行 | (具現化) | kotoba-clj + IdbBlockStore あり | ❌ `e7m actor build-wasm` 結線が gap |\n\n## Consequences\n\n- (+) 「3 substrate に deploy」が**関心事別の3登録**として整理され、aozora=compute の誤謬が消える。新 actor は `e7m actor deploy --all` で3 facet 冪等登録→実行会場を選ぶ、の一本道。\n- (+) 実行会場の双対(user-WASM / fleet-kototama)が**同一 kotoba 依存**で両立できる。publish 帰属も venue で自明に定まる。\n- (+) 既存 `nbb e7m` consolidation(ADR-2606222000)の下に3 facet が自然に収まる。新 CLI binary 不要(nbb task のリネーム)。\n- (−) `pin` / `reside` facet は未整理・R0。`identify` は shipped だが child-repo actor の manifest wiring が必要。\n- (−) browser-WASM 実行は部品揃いだが `e7m actor build-wasm` の結線が未完(WASM を第一級実行会場にするかは別 ADR/follow-up)。\n- (−) live aozora 投稿(outward)は `LEASH`(member 鍵)と PDS への actor repo 存在に依存し、本 ADR の設計上は `identify` 実行で解決するが、鍵そのものは owner 由着(no-server-key)。\n\n## Alternatives considered\n\n- **3 substrate を対等な peer deploy 先とする** — 拒否。storage/compute/publish の関心事混同を生み、aozora で actor を走らせる誤謬に至る。\n- **単一 substrate に統一** — 拒否。主権的 user-WASM と communal fleet 常駐の双対、および storage/compute の分離(CID 検証可能性)を失う。\n- **独立 CLI binary を3つ(kotoba/murakumo/aozora)新設** — 拒否。`nbb e7m` consolidation(ADR-2606222000)と衝突し、統合 CLI が乱立する(現状の e7m TS / etzhayyim-cli Go の二重化の再発)。3 substrate は `e7m actor` の下の動詞として統合。\n\n## Notes\n\n- 本 ADR は拓樸・関心事分離・CLI 命名を固定する。各 facet の深掘り(pin CLI 整理、full kotodama cell、`build-wasm` 結線)は各々の follow-up ADR/PR に委ねる。\n- tashikame/kouhou の manifest wiring(`identify` 対応)は直近の具象実装として本 ADR の直下で進める。", :adr/decision "{:topology \"3 substrate = 3 concerns (storage/compute/publish). aozora is publish-sink + identity-register, NOT compute.\", :layering \"author → kotoba(storage) → {murakumo | browser-WASM}(compute) → aozora(publish). no cycles; 3 registrations independent & idempotent.\", :facets {:kotoba {:concern :storage, :verb \"pin\", :registers \"code+state by CID\", :shipped-via \"nbb kotobase:pin / actor:mesh\"}, :murakumo {:concern :compute-resident, :verb \"reside\", :registers \"kototama (resident Pregel cell)\", :shipped-via \"nbb murakumo:deploy --node\"}, :aozora {:concern :publish, :verb \"identify\", :registers \"did+profile+lexicon on PDS (1x)\", :shipped-via \"nbb aozora:deploy [--apply]\"}}, :execution-venues [{:venue \"browser-WASM\", :mode \"user-sovereign (no-server-key pure form)\", :publish-signed-by \"user key\", :maturity :gap-wiring} {:venue \"murakumo kototama\", :mode \"communal resident (distributed inference)\", :publish-signed-by \"actor did + member CACAO leash\", :maturity :lite-runner-live-cells-r0}], :unified-cli \"under nbb e7m (ADR-2606222000): e7m actor {mesh, pin, reside, identify, deploy --all}; rename-only of existing nbb tasks, no new CLI binary\", :aozora-1-2-3 \"`e7m actor identify` (= aozora:deploy) already does (1) PDS did/profile reg, (2) LEASH member CACAO, (3) createRecord auth — ~80% shipped; gap = child-repo actor manifest wiring + owner-supplied member key\"}", :adr/honesty "{:maturity \"identify=shipped, pin/reside=partly-built/R0, browser-WASM=gap-wiring. This ADR fixes topology+ naming; per-facet depth (pin CLI, full kotodama cells, build-wasm) is follow-up.\", :outward \"live aozora publish needs owner-supplied member LEASH + actor repo on PDS; design-resolved via identify, key still owner-supplied (no-server-key).\"}", :db/id -1, :adr/problem "{:source \"owner directive 2026-07-02 (deploy Q&A)\", :investigated [\"kotoba Rust CLI (gftdcojp/net-kotobase)\" \"nbb murakumo:deploy / fleet:probe\" \"nbb aozora:deploy + aozora_deploy.cljc\" \"nbb e7m consolidation (ADR-2606222000)\" \"kotoba-clj WASM compiler + IdbBlockStore\"], :gap \"3 substrate CLI を『対等な deploy 先』と見做すと storage/compute/publish が混同され、aozora で actor を走らせる誤謬と CLI の乱立(e7m TS / etzhayyim-cli Go 二重化の再発)を生む\", :risk \"aozora=compute の誤謬、依存の循環、実行会場(user-WASM vs fleet)と publish 帰属の分離不明確\"}", :adr/alternatives "[{:option \"treat 3 substrates as peer deploy targets\", :rejected_because \"conflates storage/compute/publish; leads to the 'run the actor on aozora' category error\"} {:option \"single unified substrate\", :rejected_because \"loses the user-sovereign-WASM vs communal-fleet dual and the CID-verifiable storage/compute split\"} {:option \"three new standalone CLI binaries (kotoba/murakumo/aozora)\", :rejected_because \"collides with nbb e7m consolidation (ADR-2606222000); reproduces the e7m-TS / etzhayyim-cli-Go duplication\"}]", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607022300: actor deploy 3-substrate topology — kotoba=storage / murakumo=compute / aozora=publish + unified e7m actor CLI", :adr/source-format "edn"}]